{"id":"66452054e74f936a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md","title":"Elementary Map","display":"df-elementary-map — Elementary Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary-map","aliases":["58-df-elementary-map","Elementary Map"],"display":"df-elementary-map — Elementary Map","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary-map</span><span>Elementary Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-map — Elementary Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structures with universes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)=N\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)=N\\)</span> (universe operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq M\">\\(A\\subseteq M\\)</span> (domain of a partial map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in N^M\">\\(f\\in N^M\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in N^A\">\\(f\\in N^A\\)</span> (total or partial map candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (formulas and sentences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\\)</span> (object-level satisfaction package, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span> (assignment predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map\\text{-}partial}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,A,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq M\\land f\\in N^A\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land N=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(\\bar x(i)=\\bar x(j)\\to i=j)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\\forall s_{\\mathcal M},s_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_{\\mathcal N})\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal M}(\\bar x(i))=\\bar a(i)\\land s_{\\mathcal N}(\\bar x(i))=f(\\bar a(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,s_{\\mathcal M})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\varphi,s_{\\mathcal N})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map\\text{-}partial}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,A,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq M\\land f\\in N^A\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land N=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(\\bar x(i)=\\bar x(j)\\to i=j)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\\forall s_{\\mathcal M},s_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_{\\mathcal N})\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal M}(\\bar x(i))=\\bar a(i)\\land s_{\\mathcal N}(\\bar x(i))=f(\\bar a(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,s_{\\mathcal M})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\varphi,s_{\\mathcal N})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathcal L}(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N) \\leftrightarrow f\\in N^M\\land\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,M,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathcal L}(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N) \\leftrightarrow f\\in N^M\\land\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,M,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall s_{\\mathcal M},s_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\sigma,s_{\\mathcal M})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\sigma,s_{\\mathcal N})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall s_{\\mathcal M},s_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\sigma,s_{\\mathcal M})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\sigma,s_{\\mathcal N})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Elementary map: preserves all first-order truths; stronger than partial isomorphism</li>\n<li>Satisfaction is witnessed by the registered object-level maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span>; the definition does not use an unguarded metalinguistic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> symbol.</li>\n<li>The empty or a merely finite structure-preserving map does not by itself characterize elementary equivalence; sentence agreement does.</li>\n<li>Back-and-forth systems require explicit extension clauses beyond partial elementarity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}$ (free-variable operator, see [[58-df-free-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})$ (object-level satisfaction package, see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)$ (assignment predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)=N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in N^M","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in N^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map\\text{-}partial}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,A,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq M\\land f\\in N^A\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land N=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(\\bar x(i)=\\bar x(j)\\to i=j)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\\forall s_{\\mathcal M},s_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_{\\mathcal N})\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal M}(\\bar x(i))=\\bar a(i)\\land s_{\\mathcal N}(\\bar x(i))=f(\\bar a(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,s_{\\mathcal M})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\varphi,s_{\\mathcal N})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathcal L}(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N) \\leftrightarrow f\\in N^M\\land\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,M,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}map\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall s_{\\mathcal M},s_{\\mathcal N}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,s_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\sigma,s_{\\mathcal M})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\sigma,s_{\\mathcal N})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false}],"bytes":4555,"backlinks":[{"id":"21aca82552a5a872","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}$ (部分初等映射谓词, see [[../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-471","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md|58-df-elementary-map]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["923884eb8fe4e61d","8b6a90316aad78a4","65418b505fc53093","44e32f3fb4334e0c","64f35ba2e87964e0","715a32e91161b34f"]}